## Dropped: Part B - file:line / IDE anchors (decided 2026-06-11)

Was: `--pc-start/--pc-end` learn `file.c:NN` resolved via the DWARF
line table; `andes-sim resolve` subcommand; thin IDE layer. Dropped:
markers (<andes_sim/roi.h>) + PC symbols already cover ROI selection,
and line anchors are fuzzy under -O2 (lines move or vanish) in a way
markers are not. (Note: the -g it needed does NOT affect codegen or
the cycle figure -- debug info lives in non-loadable sections; revisit
only if a no-source-edit IDE workflow becomes a requirement.)
